### Additional Context

_No response_

### Possible Solution

See the PR https://github.com/strands-agents/sdk-python/pull/1080 
 
- strands should only redact the "output" if only "output" guardrails triggered
  - This changes the existing behavior of redacting both input and output if one
of the two if guardrailed. I'm not sure how intentional this is, but it might 
need discussion.
- In any case, blocks that contains tool outputs should certainly **not** be 
redacted in any case, as it breaks the conversation.


